A bind needs no right on the units.
A capability narrowed to name units without the right to use them would bind all the same;
a thread's units were bound through a capability with the right to bind.

Caught-by: fuzz fuzz-pmp8 fuzz-rp2350 fuzz-smp2 fuzz-work qemu-replay
Report: a place's units are malformed
Witness: fuzz time-bind-checks

diff --git a/kernel/syscall.c b/kernel/syscall.c
--- a/kernel/syscall.c
+++ b/kernel/syscall.c
@@ -1194,7 +1194,7 @@ static const struct op_shape op_shapes[OP_SHAPES] = {
     [OP_CLOCK_FRAME] = { CAP_CLOCK, RIGHT_R, SHAPE_A1 },
     [OP_CLOCK_WATCHDOG] = { CAP_CLOCK, RIGHT_W, SHAPE_A1 },
     [OP_TIME_CARVE] = { CAP_TIME, 0, SHAPE_A123 },
-    [OP_TIME_BIND] = { CAP_TIME, RIGHT_W, SHAPE_A123 },
+    [OP_TIME_BIND] = { CAP_TIME, 0, SHAPE_A123 },
 #if SCHED_USER
     [OP_TIME_SCHEDULE] = { CAP_TIME, RIGHT_W, SHAPE_A1 | SHAPE_A2 },
     [OP_TIME_DUE] = { CAP_TIME, RIGHT_W, SHAPE_A1 },
